OL,3,GNEWSALarge fire breaks out at former
OL,4,Aairfield
OL,5,
OL,6,FA large fire is being tackled at a
OL,7,Fformer airfield in Leicestershire.
OL,9,FMultiple crews are at the scene at
OL,10,FBruntingthorpe Airfield, a former RAF
OL,11,Fbase which is now used as a vehicle
OL,12,Ftest track and storage facility.
OL,14,FThere are seven fire crews and an
OL,15,Faerial ladder platform involved, said
OL,16,FLeicestershire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,17,Fat 09:00 BST on Friday.
OL,19,FA brigade spokesperson said: "There is
OL,20,Fa large plume of smoke coming from the
OL,21,Farea - local residents should close
OL,22,Fwindows and doors."
